Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The past isn't dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,James. Fate draws us back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your enemy is my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-His name is Safin.\N-And what does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge. Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When our secret finds its way out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be the death of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can imagine why\NI've come back to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a young lady in Santiago\NI want you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're late.\N-When you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.84,0:01:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Salute!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I met your new Double O.\NShe's a disarming young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I get why you shot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah well, everyone tries at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,James Bond.